out/
node_modules/
*.vsix
dist/
.vscode-test/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc

# Vendored upstream clones kept for reading during porting (e.g. repomap.py) --
# not first-party code, not meant to enter this repo's own history.
reference/

# Runtime lock file (session id/pid/timestamp) -- churns on every run, not
# meant to be version-controlled.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Internal AI-workflow docs (spec/planning drafts, session briefs, the
# Core-Rules-and-session-log file, and every session artifact under
# .claude/) -- kept locally, not part of this repo's public history.
# README.md, CHANGELOG.md, fixtures/REQUIREMENTS.md, and the
# fixtures/javascript summary-doc fixtures under docs/wiki/ are exempted:
# they're needed to set up or run this project (or, for CHANGELOG.md, are a
# real Marketplace-facing deliverable), not just to continue an AI session.
# CHANGELOG.md itself was caught by this blanket *.md rule for two weeks
# (2026-09-01 to 2026-09-16) before this exemption was added -- its content
# was recovered from git history, not rewritten from scratch.
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!fixtures/REQUIREMENTS.md
!fixtures/javascript/docs/wiki/**
.claude/
